      "en": "No one in heaven above, or on the earth, or under the earth, was able to open the book or to look in it.",
      "ko": "하늘 위에나 땅 위에나 땅 아래에 능히 책을 펴거나 보거나 할 이가 없더라",
      "source_text_hash": "37fdc120675792ebaa5d7bcb782a49f243cc958deaff577c845a50012ad08931",
      "translation_text_hash": "cda41b81abea5067cad86f27e5e61a447208c6bb9d6f31802886a68b0b67faf2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
