      "en": "Then I wept much, because no one was found worthy to open the book or to look in it.",
      "ko": "이 책을 펴거나 보거나 하기에 합당한 자가 보이지 않기로 내가 크게 울었더니",
      "source_text_hash": "f52f84c48d508a4af2bc33a924d1486ba5812c5fbdd9a7485b2b193956a207d7",
      "translation_text_hash": "e7e9bde76da34657b352fb4b95a6861da8ea5ca82882af0930ae28713fac394a",
